OL,5,G1500 Lingo
OL,6,     FQuiz hosted by Adil Ray, with
OL,7,     Ffather and son Greg and Dean from
OL,8,     FManchester, Bolton vicar Tony and
OL,9,     Fhis wife Doreen, and sisters Saira
OL,10,     Fand Farrah from Reading taking
OL,11,     Fpart. They work out words that
OL,12,     Fappear in the Lingo grids and
OL,13,     FPuzzlewords. The last remaining
OL,14,     Fduo have the opportunity to win
OL,15,     Fthe money they've banked earlier
OL,16,     Fin the show to potentially double
OL,17,     Ftheir winnings, or leaving with
OL,18,     Fnothing
